      "evidence": [
        {
          "page": 1,
          "section": "Abstract",
          "quote": "this Cr-Re pair diffusion is primarily driven by both local stress fields and inter-element charge transfer, exemplifying strain-electronic co-regulation in metallic diffusion systems",
